{"story":{"group_1":[{"autoTurnLast":0.9,"bg":"bg_adv_21441.jpg","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":101301,"motion":400,"pos":1}],"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"bgm":"bgm03_story16","chara":[{"id":101301}],"nameCenter":"Asuka","textCenter":"Then Aru-chan...","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":101301}],"textClear":1},{"autoTurnLast":0.1,"bg":"bg_adv_21441.jpg","bgChangeEffect":"cameraPan"},{"autoTurnLast":1.0},{"autoTurnLast":0.1,"bg":"bg_adv_21441.jpg","bgChangeEffect":"cameraPan"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":101301,"motion":200,"pos":1}],"nameCenter":"Asuka","textBg":"shout","textCenter":"S-SHE ESCAAAPED!?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":101301,"motion":0}],"nameCenter":"Asuka","textCenter":"Ahhh... Asuka you absolute fool!!"},{"chara":[{"id":101301}],"nameCenter":"Asuka","textCenter":"You missed the perfect chance to apprehend@a fugitive..."},{"chara":[{"id":101301}],"nameCenter":"Asuka","textCenter":"What am I going to tell Kagome-san..."},{"chara":[{"id":101301,"motion":300}],"nameCenter":"Asuka","textCenter":"Uuu...now that it's come to this, I'll have to perform@ritual suicide as apology...!"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"chara":[{"id":101301,"pos":0}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":300601,"motion":200,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"Emiri","textRight":"Asukyan! Whatcha mumbling over there@all by yourself!?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":101301,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"Asuka","textLeft":"*Gasp*— ...Emiri-san!?@Why are you here..."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":300301,"motion":200,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"Hinano","textRight":"The front door was left open."},{"chara":[{"id":300301}],"nameRight":"Hinano","textRight":"We heard loud noises coming from inside,@and sorry, but we let ourselves in."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":300901,"motion":400,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"Manaka","textRight":"Was all that running around Aru-chan@by any chance!?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":101301,"motion":100}],"nameLeft":"Asuka","textLeft":"Indeed it was!!"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":300201,"motion":100,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"Natsuki","textRight":"Knew it! What was she up to this time?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":101301,"motion":300}],"nameLeft":"Asuka","textLeft":"Well... That I didn't understand..."},{"chara":[{"id":101301}],"nameLeft":"Asuka","textLeft":"She was frantically pointing at this oni samurai@helmet, that bundle of swords, and the living room..."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":300601,"motion":300,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"Emiri","textRight":"Again with the nonsense!"},{"chara":[{"id":101301,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"Asuka","textLeft":"Oni helmet, bundle, living room, helmet, swords, room—over and over and over again..."},{"chara":[{"id":101301}],"nameLeft":"Asuka","textLeft":"My head is spinning just thinking about it..."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":300901,"motion":300,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"Manaka","textRight":"Mmm...it's still going to be a while before@we solve this, isn't it..."},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":101301},{"effect":"fadeout","id":300901}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":300301,"motion":0,"pos":1}],"nameCenter":"Hinano","textCenter":"Oni helmet, bundle, living room...@Oni, bundle, living..."},{"bgm":"stop","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":300301,"lipSynch":0}],"nameCenter":"Hinano","textCenter":"…………"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":300301,"motion":400}],"nameCenter":"Hinano","textCenter":"[chara:300301:effect_emotion_surprise_0][se:7226_shock]...*Gasp*...!?"},{"chara":[{"id":300301}],"nameCenter":"Hinano","textCenter":"...Oi!!! Could it be..."},{"bgm":"bgm05_event08","chara":[{"id":300301}],"nameCenter":"Hinano","textCenter":"Isn't this some kind of message!?"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"chara":[{"id":300301,"pos":2}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":300601,"motion":400,"pos":0}],"nameLeft":"Emiri","textLeft":"Ehh!?"},{"chara":[{"id":300301,"motion":0}],"nameRight":"Hinano","textRight":"If what she was doing to us wasn't just@some wild attacking,"},{"chara":[{"id":300301}],"nameRight":"Hinano","textRight":"but some kind of message..."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":300301,"motion":200}],"nameRight":"Hinano","textRight":"One more time—@let's analyze Aru-chan's behavior!!"},{"autoTurnLast":1.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":300301,"motion":0,"pos":0},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":300901,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"chara":[{"id":300301}],"nameLeft":"Hinano","textLeft":"First was Manaka's place?","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"chara":[{"id":300301}],"nameLeft":"Hinano","textLeft":"Where she was messing around with ingredients."},{"chara":[{"id":300901,"motion":100}],"nameRight":"Manaka","textRight":"Right! Turnips and onions."},{"chara":[{"id":300301,"motion":100}],"nameLeft":"Hinano","textLeft":"And then she went to my place."},{"chara":[{"id":300301}],"nameLeft":"Hinano","textLeft":"She took the chemistry club's periodic table@and started erasing letters..."},{"chara":[{"id":300301}],"nameLeft":"Hinano","textLeft":"Specifically the \"gon\" from \"Argon\"."},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":300301},{"effect":"fadeout","id":300901}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":300601,"motion":200,"pos":2},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":101301,"motion":0,"pos":0}],"nameRight":"Emiri","textRight":"So like whatever's \"Argon\" isn't actually@\"gone\", right?"},{"chara":[{"id":101301}],"nameLeft":"Asuka","textLeft":"Something about a root vegetable or something@with layers isn't gone...!"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":300601},{"effect":"fadeout","id":101301}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":300301,"motion":200,"pos":0},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":300201,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"nameLeft":"Hinano","textLeft":"Next is Natsuki's place."},{"chara":[{"id":300301}],"nameLeft":"Hinano","textLeft":"She threw a ball at you, correct?"},{"chara":[{"id":300201,"motion":100}],"nameRight":"Natsuki","textRight":"Yeah, an incredible splitter pitch."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":300201,"motion":400}],"nameRight":"Natsuki","textRight":"Wait a sec—\"split\"!"},{"chara":[{"id":300301,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"Hinano","textLeft":"Next is Emiri's place. She just fell over without@doing anything?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":300601,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"Emiri","textRight":"Now that I think about it... There might've been@picture books tossed around."},{"chara":[{"id":300601,"motion":200}],"nameRight":"Emiri","textRight":"That \"Witch of the South Pole\" series!"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":300301},{"effect":"fadeout","id":300601}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":101301,"motion":0,"pos":0},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":300901,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"nameLeft":"Asuka","textLeft":"Root...layers...witch...split..."},{"chara":[{"id":101301,"motion":300}],"nameLeft":"Asuka","textLeft":"Mmm, I still don't understand the vegetable@connection..."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":300901,"lipSynch":0,"motion":400}],"nameRight":"Manaka","textRight":"...!!"},{"chara":[{"id":300901}],"nameRight":"Manaka","textRight":"Maybe she was trying to say \"root\" like \"original\",@but there's more of it like \"layers\"?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":101301,"motion":400}],"nameLeft":"Asuka","textLeft":"Ah—... I see!"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":300201,"motion":1,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"Natsuki","textRight":"Is there some secret about a Familiar that split@from its Witch or something?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":300601,"motion":400,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"Emiri","textRight":"What the heeeck! That's super duper cryptic!"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":300301,"motion":0,"pos":0}],"nameLeft":"Hinano","textLeft":"Even so, Aru-chan was trying to warn us of danger@in her own way."},{"chara":[{"id":300301}],"nameLeft":"Hinano","textLeft":"With the fear of her being manipulated by a Witch,@though, we can't draw any solid conclusions,"},{"chara":[{"id":300301,"motion":100}],"nameLeft":"Hinano","textLeft":"but for now let's assume she's warning us@of danger."},{"chara":[{"id":300301}],"nameLeft":"Hinano","textLeft":"It's not like we have any other leads."},{"autoTurnLast":2.0,"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"}]},"version":3}
